    </p>

    <button class="btn" onclick="goTo('countdown')">
      Start the Surprise ✨
    </button>

    <div class="scroll">
      ↓ Scroll for your surprise ↓
    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- COUNTDOWN -->

<section id="countdown">

  <div class="content">

    <h2 class="section-title">The Wait Is Almost Over 🥹</h2>

    <p class="section-sub">
      New Year 2027 — a new beginning, new memories,
      and hopefully lots of laughter. ❤️
    </p>

    <div class="countdown">

      <div class="time-box glass">
        <strong id="days">00</strong>
        <span>DAYS</span>
      </div>

      <div class="time-box glass">
        <strong id="hours">00</strong>
        <span>HOURS</span>
      </div>

      <div class="time-box glass">
        <strong id="minutes">00</strong>
        <span>MINUTES</span>
      </div>

      <div class="time-box glass">
        <strong id="seconds">00</strong>
        <span>SECONDS</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <br><br>

    <button class="btn" onclick="goTo('letter')">
      Continue ❤️
    </button>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- LETTER -->

<section id="letter">

  <div class="content">

    <h2 class="section-title">A Little Something For You 💌</h2>

    <p class="section-sub">
      Kuch baatein jo shayad normal message mein kabhi properly nahi bol paaya...
    </p>

    <div class="letter glass">

      <p>
        Dear Mini,
      </p>

      <p>
        Pata hai, kisi apne ko miss karna ajeeb sa hota hai.
        Kabhi koi chhoti si cheez yaad dila deti hai,
        kabhi koi purani baat aur kabhi bas randomly
        tumhari yaad aa jaati hai. 🥹
      </p>

      <p>
        Pichhla time tumse door rehkar nikla,
        aur honestly...
        <span class="highlight">I missed you a lot.</span> 🫂
      </p>

      <p>
        Tumhari hasi, bakchodi, random conversations,
        aur woh chhote-chhote moments —
        sab yaad aaye.
      </p>

      <p>
        Lekin iss New Year mein ek cheez alag hai...
        <span class="highlight">tum wapas aa rahi ho.</span> ❤️
      </p>

      <p>
        Isliye 2027 mere liye sirf ek new year nahi hai.
        Ye ek chance hai aur memories banane ka,
        aur bahut saari hasi wapas lane ka. ✨
      </p>

      <p>
        Bas ek wish hai —
        tum hamesha khush raho,
        smile karti raho,
        aur iss saal tumhare paas
        yaad rakhne layak bahut saare beautiful moments ho.
      </p>

      <p>
        <span class="highlight">
          Welcome back, Mini. 🫂❤️
        </span>
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- MEMORIES -->

<section>

  <div class="content">

    <h2 class="section-title">Things I Missed 🥹</h2>

    <p class="section-sub">
      Some things are small, but somehow they become the biggest memories.
    </p>

    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card glass">
        <div class="card-icon">😂</div>
        <h3>The Bakchodi</h3>
        <p>
          Random jokes, stupid conversations,
          aur bina reason ke hasi.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card glass">
        <div class="card-icon">🫂</div>
        <h3>The Presence</h3>
        <p>
          Bas tumhara aas-paas hona hi
          somehow sab kuch better bana deta hai.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card glass">
        <div class="card-icon">🌷</div>
        <h3>The Memories</h3>
        <p>
          Woh chhoti-chhoti moments
          jo time ke saath aur special lagne lagte hain.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- TIMELINE -->

<section>

  <div class="content">

    <h2 class="section-title">A New Chapter ✨</h2>

    <p class="section-sub">
      2027 ke liye ek tiny little promise...
    </p>

    <div class="timeline">

      <div class="timeline-item">

        <div class="dot"></div>

        <h3>01 — Finally Together Again 🫂</h3>

        <p>
          Itna wait karne ke baad finally woh moment
          jab Mini wapas hogi.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="timeline-item">

        <div class="dot"></div>

        <h3>02 — More Laughs 😂</h3>

        <p>
          Purani bakchodi ko double speed par continue karna.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="timeline-item">

        <div class="dot"></div>

        <h3>03 — More Memories 📸</h3>

        <p>
          Aise moments create karna jo baad mein
          yaad karke smile aaye.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="timeline-item">

        <div class="dot"></div>

        <h3>04 — A Happy 2027 ❤️</h3>

        <p>
          Bas happiness, peace, laughter aur
          beautiful memories.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- SURPRISE -->

<section>

  <div class="content">

    <div class="surprise-box glass">

      <div class="lock" id="lock">🎁</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">
        One Last Surprise...
      </h2>

      <p class="section-sub">
        Is button ko press karne ke baad
        fireworks ke liye ready rehna. 🎆
      </p>

      <button class="btn" id="surpriseBtn" onclick="openSurprise()">
        Open My Surprise 💌
      </button>

      <div class="hidden-message" id="hiddenMessage">

        <div class="big-text">
          YOU'RE BACK! 🥹❤️
        </div>

        <p class="section-sub">
          Aur bhai...
